<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-PROVISIONAL RESULTS AT MEN'S WORLD CUP SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-PROVISIONAL RESULTS AT MEN'S WORLD CUP SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>PARK CITY, Utah 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Provisional leading</p>
<p>results of World Cup men's slalom on Sunday (tabulate under</p>
<p>combined time, first run, second run):</p>
<p>1. Thomas Sykora (Austria) 1:46.03 (51.49-54.54)</p>
<p>2. Thomas Stangassinger (Austria) 1:46.32 (51.82-54.50)</p>
<p>3. Kjetil Andre Aamodt (Norway) 1:46.91 (52.97-53.94)</p>
<p>4. Christian Mayer (Austria) 1:47.08 (52.20-54.88)</p>
<p>5. Ole Christian Furuseth (Norway) 1:47.12 (52.50-54.62)</p>
<p>6. Michael Tritscher (Austria) 1:47.34 (52.36-54.98)</p>
<p>7. Kiminobu Kimura (Japan) 1:47.47 (53.73-53.74)</p>
<p>8. Tom Stiansen (Norway) 1:47.56 (52.82-54.74)</p>
<p>9. Finn Christian Jagge (Norway) 1:47.68 (53.58-54.10</p>
<p>10. Jure Kosir (Slovenia) 1:47.72 (53.11-54.61)</p>
